  "question_stem": "A fair red spinner has 4 sides, numbered 1, 2, 3, 4. A fair blue spinner has 3 sides, numbered 1, 2, 3. When a spinner is spun, the score is the number on the side on which it lands. The spinners are spun at the same time. The random variable $X$ denotes the score on the red spinner minus the score on the blue spinner.",
